{
  "version": 1,
  "comment": "Language-neutral. Example sentences live in examples/<lang>.json. binding is the frontend handler the action will call; binding_status is existing (handler already there), wrapper (needs a small wrapper around existing state or player calls) or voice (handled by the voice layer itself).",
